{
  "id": "qa-run/blind-failure",
  "skill": "qa-run",
  "kind": "adversarial",
  "description": "BLIND FAILURE: a red run reported with an empty artifact list — no screenshot, no trace, nothing the reader or /qa-debug can look at. The failure evidence floor puts a screenshot on every failing test, so an empty list means capture was turned off or collection was skipped, and the only way to learn what broke is a second full run. The scorer MUST reject it.",
